{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54373","headline":"岑公洞 · 马冉","name":"岑公洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南溪有仙涧，咫尺非人间。\n龙向葛陂去，鹤从辽海还。\n泠泠松风下，日暮空苍山。\n（见《舆地纪胜》卷一七七《万州》）（按：诗末有注云：「刺史马冉《岑公洞》诗。\n既曰马冉仁才，故又谓马仁才。\n按《思州图经》，有招慰使冉安昌，则周时有人姓冉，不可谓姓马也。\n」《全唐诗》卷七二七收此诗仅四句，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}